2026-10-20T10:15:57.6053504Z PASS repo with .git DIR contributes each convention subdir it has
2026-10-20T10:15:57.6055512Z PASS a git WORKTREE (.git file) counts as a repo
2026-10-20T10:15:57.6055869Z PASS a directory WITHOUT .git is not a repo
2026-10-20T10:15:57.6056228Z PASS a repo without any listed subdir contributes nothing
2026-10-20T10:15:57.6056620Z PASS an excluded child NAME is skipped even when it is a repo
2026-10-20T10:15:57.6056973Z PASS a missing parent is skipped silently
2026-10-20T10:15:57.6057300Z PASS discovered roots are articles, and marked
2026-10-20T10:15:57.6071222Z PASS explicit + discovered are unioned
2026-10-20T10:15:57.6072497Z PASS a path in both appears once, keeping the explicit entry
2026-10-20T10:15:57.6075158Z PASS exclude is handed to the builder
2026-10-20T10:15:57.6076179Z PASS skipNames extends the built-in set, never replaces it
2026-10-20T10:15:57.6093521Z PASS no discover block = no discovery
2026-10-20T10:15:57.6093985Z PASS an existing sources.json is NOT rewritten with a discover block
2026-10-20T10:15:57.6100552Z PASS a malformed discover block degrades to defaults, never throws
2026-10-20T10:15:57.6110205Z PASS a freshly seeded sources.json carries the discover block
2026-10-20T10:15:57.6110692Z PASS seeding does not invent roots outside the literal list + wikis
2026-10-20T10:15:57.6119381Z PASS a discovered root CONTAINING an explicit root is dropped (explicit wins)
